/* 每日一句：610 句 B1 英文勵志句（附中文、重點單字），依日期輪替，考前不重複。欄位：[en, zh, word, wordZh, src] */
window.DAILY_SENTENCES = [["One child, one teacher, one book, one pen can change the world.","一個孩子、一位老師、一本書、一支筆，就能改變世界。","change the world","改變世界","Malala Yousafzai"],["Constant dripping wears away the stone.","滴水穿石。","wears away","逐漸磨損；侵蝕","Proverb"],["Every cloud has a silver lining.","每片烏雲都鑲著銀邊；黑暗中總有一線希望。","silver lining","一線希望","Proverb"],["Time and tide wait for no man.","時間和潮水都不等人；歲月不待人。","tide","潮汐","Proverb"],["A kind word can warm someone's heart for a whole day.","一句親切的話，就能讓人一整天心裡都暖暖的。","warm","使溫暖",""],["Don't cross the bridge until you come to it.","船到橋頭自然直，別為還沒發生的事煩惱。","cross","過（橋）；越過","Proverb"],["The more that you read, the more things you will know.","你讀得越多，懂得的事情就越多。","the more","越……就越……","Dr. Seuss"],["It's always darkest before the dawn.","黎明前總是最黑暗的時刻。","dawn","黎明；破曉","Proverb"],["A smooth sea never made a skilled sailor.","平靜的海洋，造就不出熟練的水手。","skilled","熟練的；有技術的",""],["An apple a day keeps the doctor away.","一天一蘋果，醫生遠離我。","keeps the doctor away","讓醫生遠離（保持健康）","Proverb"],["Small acts of kindness can make a big difference in someone's life.","小小的善舉，也能為別人的生活帶來很大的改變。","make a big difference","帶來很大的改變",""],["When in Rome, do as the Romans do.","入境隨俗。","When in Rome","入境隨俗","Proverb"],["Lost time is never found again.","失去的時間，再也找不回來。","Lost time","失去的時間","Benjamin Franklin"],["There are no gains without pains.","沒有付出，就沒有收穫。","gains","收穫；獲益","Benjamin Franklin"],["Experience is the name everyone gives to their mistakes.","經驗，就是每個人給自己的錯誤取的名字。","Experience","經驗","Oscar Wilde"],["A stitch in time saves nine.","及時縫一針，省下九針；小洞不補，大洞吃苦。","stitch","（縫紉的）一針","Proverb"],["Hold the door for the person behind you; small gestures matter.","幫後面的人扶一下門吧，小小的舉動也很重要。","gestures","舉動、姿態",""],["Don't put off until tomorrow what you can do today.","今日事，今日畢。","put off","拖延；延後","Proverb"],["Well done is better than well said.","做得好，勝過說得好。","better than","比……更好","Benjamin Franklin"],["One today is worth two tomorrows.","一個今天，抵得上兩個明天。","worth","值得；相當於…的價值","Benjamin Franklin"],["I learned that courage was not the absence of fear, but the triumph over it.","我明白了，勇氣不是沒有恐懼，而是戰勝恐懼。","triumph over","戰勝；克服","Nelson Mandela"],["There is no time like the present.","沒有比現在更好的時機。","present","現在；目前","Proverb"],["Kindness is free, so share it with everyone you meet.","善良不用花錢，所以就分享給你遇到的每個人吧。","share","分享",""],["Variety is the spice of life.","多樣的變化是生活的調味料。","Variety","多樣化；變化","Proverb"],["Early to bed and early to rise makes a man healthy, wealthy, and wise.","早睡早起，使人健康、富有又聰明。","wealthy","富有的","Proverb"],["Small steps every day can lead to big changes.","每天跨出一小步，就能帶來大改變。","lead to","導致；帶來",""],["The only thing we have to fear is fear itself.","我們唯一需要恐懼的，就是恐懼本身。","fear","恐懼；害怕","Franklin D. Roosevelt"],["Procrastination is the thief of time.","拖延是偷走時間的小偷。","Procrastination","拖延","Edward Young"],["When you help others, you often end up helping yourself too.","當你幫助別人時，最後往往也幫助了自己。","end up","最後、到頭來",""],["Necessity is the mother of invention.","需要為發明之母。","Necessity","需要；必要性","Proverb"],["Diligence is the mother of good luck.","勤奮是好運之母。","Diligence","勤奮","Benjamin Franklin"],["Try to be just one percent better than you were yesterday.","試著比昨天的自己進步百分之一就好。","percent","百分比；百分之…",""],["Optimism is the faith that leads to achievement.","樂觀是通往成就的信念。","achievement","成就","Helen Keller"],["Haste makes waste, so take your time and do things right.","欲速則不達，慢慢來，把事情做好。","Haste","匆忙；急躁",""],["Listening carefully is one of the kindest things you can do.","用心傾聽，是你能做的最體貼的事之一。","kindest","最善良的、最體貼的",""],["Life is either a daring adventure, or nothing.","人生若不是一場大膽的冒險，就什麼都不是。","daring","大膽的；勇敢的","Helen Keller"],["Imagination is more important than knowledge.","想像力比知識更重要。","Imagination","想像力","Albert Einstein"],["Seeds don't turn into trees overnight, but they never stop growing.","種子不會一夜之間長成大樹，但它們從不停止成長。","overnight","一夜之間",""],["I've failed over and over and over again in my life, and that is why I succeed.","我這一生失敗了一次又一次，而這正是我成功的原因。","over and over again","一再地；反覆地","Michael Jordan"],["Plan your day the night before, and your morning will feel much easier.","前一晚就規劃好隔天，早晨會輕鬆許多。","the night before","前一晚",""],["Thank the bus driver; a little gratitude goes a long way.","向公車司機說聲謝謝吧，一點點感謝就能帶來很大的影響。","goes a long way","大有幫助、影響深遠",""],["I have no special talent. I am only passionately curious.","我沒有特別的天分，我只是充滿強烈的好奇心。","passionately","熱烈地；熱切地","Albert Einstein"],["A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.","千里之行，始於足下。","journey","旅程","Laozi"],["Like coins in a piggy bank, a little study each day adds up.","就像存進撲滿的硬幣，每天讀一點書，也會慢慢累積起來。","adds up","累積起來；積少成多",""],["It's okay to make mistakes; that's what practice is for.","犯錯沒關係，練習本來就是為了這個。","make mistakes","犯錯",""],["A short to-do list is better than a long list you never finish.","一份簡短的待辦清單，勝過一份永遠做不完的長清單。","to-do list","待辦清單",""],["Good manners can open doors that money cannot.","良好的禮貌能打開金錢打不開的門。","manners","禮貌、禮儀",""],["Not all those who wander are lost.","四處漫遊的人，並非都迷失了方向。","wander","漫遊；閒逛","J.R.R. Tolkien"],["The pen is mightier than the sword.","筆比劍更有力量（文字的力量勝過武力）。","mightier","更有力量的（mighty 的比較級）","Edward Bulwer-Lytton"],["Learn ten new words a day, and you will know thousands by next year.","每天學十個新單字，到明年你就會認識好幾千個單字。","thousands","數以千計",""],["A wrong answer today can lead to the right answer tomorrow.","今天的錯誤答案，可能帶你找到明天的正確答案。","lead to","導致；通往",""],["Do the hardest task first, and the rest of the day will feel lighter.","先做最難的事，接下來一整天都會輕鬆一些。","lighter","較輕鬆的",""],["Offer your seat to someone who needs it more than you do.","把座位讓給比你更需要的人吧。","Offer","提供、讓出",""],["That's one small step for man, one giant leap for mankind.","這是個人的一小步，卻是人類的一大步。","giant leap","巨大的躍進","Neil Armstrong"],["Rome wasn't built in a day.","羅馬不是一天造成的。","built","建造（build 的過去分詞）","Proverb"],["Fifteen minutes of reading every day beats three hours once a month.","每天閱讀十五分鐘，勝過一個月才讀一次三小時。","beats","勝過；打敗",""],["Every mistake you make is a lesson in disguise.","你犯下的每個錯誤，都是一堂偽裝起來的課。","in disguise","偽裝的；變相的",""],["Ten focused minutes are worth more than an hour of distracted work.","專注的十分鐘，勝過分心的一小時。","distracted","分心的",""],["Smiling at strangers can make the world feel a little friendlier.","對陌生人微笑，能讓這個世界感覺更友善一點。","strangers","陌生人",""],["Education is the most powerful weapon which you can use to change the world.","教育是你能用來改變世界最強大的武器。","powerful","強大的；有力的","Nelson Mandela"],["Where there's a will, there's a way.","有志者，事竟成。","will","意志、決心","Proverb"],["Take time to look back at how far you've come, not just how far you have to go.","花點時間回頭看看自己已經走了多遠，而不只是還有多遠要走。","look back","回顧；回頭看",""],["Your mistakes do not define you; your choices do.","錯誤不能定義你，你的選擇才能。","define","定義；界定",""],["Break big goals into small steps, and take one step today.","把大目標拆成小步驟，今天就先跨出一步。","goals","目標",""],["Be gentle with others, because everyone is facing something you cannot see.","對別人溫柔一點，因為每個人都在面對你看不見的難題。","gentle","溫柔的、溫和的",""],["To travel hopefully is a better thing than to arrive.","懷抱希望地旅行，勝過抵達終點。","hopefully","懷抱希望地","Robert Louis Stevenson"],["Slow and steady wins the race.","穩紮穩打，才能贏得比賽。","steady","穩定的","Proverb"],["Nobody learns to swim by reading about it; you have to get in the water.","沒有人是靠看書學會游泳的，你必須親自下水才行。","get in the water","下水",""],["Each red mark on your test shows you where to improve.","考卷上的每個紅色記號，都告訴你哪裡還能進步。","improve","改進；進步",""],["Being busy is not the same as being productive.","忙碌不等於有效率。","productive","有成效的；有生產力的",""],["Speak to yourself as kindly as you would speak to a good friend.","對自己說話時，要像對好朋友說話一樣溫柔。","kindly","親切地、溫柔地",""],["Big dreams start with small, brave actions you take today.","遠大的夢想，始於你今天勇敢踏出的小小行動。","brave","勇敢的",""],["It's never too late to learn.","學習永遠不嫌晚。","never too late","永遠不嫌晚","Proverb"],["When you feel like quitting, remember why you started.","當你想放棄的時候，想想自己當初為什麼開始。","feel like","想要；有…的念頭",""],["Treat every mistake as a stepping stone, not a stumbling block.","把每個錯誤當作墊腳石，而不是絆腳石。","stepping stone","墊腳石",""],["A few minutes of planning can save you hours of stress.","花幾分鐘做規劃，就能省下好幾個小時的壓力。","planning","規劃；計畫",""],["Treat others the way you would like to be treated.","你希望別人怎麼對待你，就怎麼對待別人。","Treat","對待",""],["Ask questions freely; curiosity is the key that opens new doors.","盡情發問吧；好奇心是開啟新大門的鑰匙。","curiosity","好奇心",""],["The early bird catches the worm.","早起的鳥兒有蟲吃。","early bird","早起的鳥兒；早起的人","Proverb"],["It's okay to rest, but it's not okay to give up.","休息沒關係，但放棄就不行。","give up","放棄",""],["A mistake only becomes a failure if you refuse to learn from it.","只有當你拒絕從中學習時，錯誤才會變成失敗。","refuse","拒絕",""],["Write your deadlines on a calendar so they never surprise you.","把截止日期寫在行事曆上，就不會措手不及。","deadlines","截止期限",""],["Lend a hand to a classmate who is struggling with homework.","幫幫正在為作業苦惱的同學吧。","Lend a hand","幫忙、伸出援手",""],["The future is not something you wait for; it is something you create.","未來不是等來的，而是自己創造出來的。","create","創造",""],["Never put off till tomorrow what you can do today.","今日事，今日畢。","put off","拖延","Proverb"],["Falling down is part of learning; getting up is part of growing.","跌倒是學習的一部分，重新站起來則是成長的一部分。","getting up","站起來",""],["Smile at your mistakes, and then fix them.","對你的錯誤微笑，然後改正它們。","fix","修正；改正",""],["Say no to things that steal time from what matters most.","學會對那些搶走重要事情時間的事說「不」。","matters","要緊；重要（動詞）",""],["Give someone a sincere compliment today and watch their face light up.","今天真誠地稱讚一個人，看看他臉上綻放的笑容吧。","compliment","讚美、稱讚",""],["Traveling teaches lessons that no textbook can fully explain.","旅行教會你的事，是任何課本都無法完整解釋的。","fully","完全地；充分地",""],["Two heads are better than one.","三個臭皮匠，勝過一個諸葛亮。","heads","腦袋；（引申為）人的智慧","Proverb"],["Diamonds are formed under pressure, and so are strong people.","鑽石是在壓力下形成的，堅強的人也是。","pressure","壓力",""],["Saying \"I don't understand\" is the first step to understanding.","說出「我不懂」，是理解的第一步。","the first step","第一步",""],["Good time management is really about managing your choices.","良好的時間管理，其實就是管理你的選擇。","time management","時間管理",""],["Write a note of encouragement for a friend before a big exam.","在大考前，寫一張鼓勵的小紙條給朋友吧。","encouragement","鼓勵",""],["Keep your eyes on your goal, not on the obstacles in your way.","把目光放在目標上，而不是眼前的障礙。","obstacles","障礙",""],["Don't judge a book by its cover.","不要以貌取人（不要只憑封面評斷一本書）。","judge","評斷","Proverb"],["A setback is just a bump in the road, not the end of it.","挫折只是路上的一個小顛簸，而不是路的盡頭。","setback","挫折",""],["You learn more from one honest mistake than from ten lucky guesses.","從一個誠實的錯誤中學到的，比十次幸運猜中還要多。","guesses","猜測（guess 的複數）",""],["Review your notes for ten minutes a day instead of cramming before the test.","每天花十分鐘複習筆記，而不是考前臨時抱佛腳。","cramming","臨時抱佛腳；死記硬背",""],["Kindness grows when we pass it on to others.","當我們把善意傳遞給別人，善意就會越來越多。","pass it on","傳遞下去",""],["A map can show you the way, but you must take the first step yourself.","地圖能為你指路，但第一步必須由你自己踏出。","take the first step","踏出第一步",""],["If at first you don't succeed, try, try again.","一次不成功，就再試一次、再試一次。","succeed","成功","Proverb"],["You only truly fail when you stop trying.","只有當你不再嘗試時，才是真正的失敗。","truly","真正地",""],["Everyone makes mistakes, even your teachers and your heroes.","每個人都會犯錯，就連你的老師和偶像也一樣。","heroes","英雄；偶像",""],["If a task takes less than two minutes, do it right away.","如果一件事兩分鐘內就能完成，就馬上去做。","right away","立刻；馬上",""],["A kind heart is more beautiful than a pretty face.","一顆善良的心，比漂亮的臉蛋更美。","kind heart","善良的心",""],["The more you learn about the world, the more interesting it becomes.","你對世界了解得越多，它就變得越有趣。","learn about","了解；學習有關……",""],["All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.","只讀書不玩耍，聰明孩子也會變呆。","dull","遲鈍的；乏味的","Proverb"],["A low score is a signal to work smarter, not a reason to quit.","分數低是提醒你要用更聰明的方法努力，而不是放棄的理由。","signal","訊號；信號",""],["Fear of failure should never stop you from trying.","害怕失敗，永遠不該成為你不去嘗試的理由。","Fear of failure","對失敗的恐懼",""],["Wasting time today means hurrying tomorrow.","今天浪費時間，明天就得手忙腳亂。","Wasting","浪費",""],["Help without expecting anything in return.","幫助別人，不求任何回報。","in return","作為回報",""],["Your plans may change along the way, and that is perfectly okay.","你的計畫可能會在過程中改變，這完全沒關係。","along the way","在過程中；一路上",""],["You must learn to walk before you can run.","要先學會走，才能學跑（凡事要循序漸進）。","walk before you can run","先學走再學跑；循序漸進","Proverb"],["Hard times teach you lessons that easy times never can.","艱難的時刻，能教會你順遂時永遠學不到的事。","lessons","教訓；道理",""],["Successful people fail too; they just don't stay down.","成功的人也會失敗，只是他們不會一蹶不振。","stay down","倒地不起；一蹶不振",""],["Set a clear goal for each study session before you open your book.","每次打開書本之前，先替這段讀書時間設定一個明確的目標。","session","（一段）時間；一節",""],["Respect everyone, no matter how different they are from you.","尊重每一個人，不論他們和你有多麼不同。","no matter how","無論多麼",""],["Every new place you visit leaves a small mark on your heart.","你造訪的每個新地方，都會在心裡留下小小的印記。","mark","印記；痕跡",""],["Hope for the best, but prepare for the worst.","抱最大的希望，做最壞的打算。","prepare for","為……做準備","Proverb"],["Keep knocking, and one day the door will open.","持續敲門，總有一天門會為你打開。","knocking","敲（門）",""],["Correct one mistake today, and you won't repeat it tomorrow.","今天改正一個錯誤，明天就不會再犯。","repeat","重複；再犯",""],["You don't need more time; you need to use your time more wisely.","你需要的不是更多時間，而是更聰明地運用時間。","wisely","明智地；聰明地",""],["When a classmate is left out, invite them to join your group.","當有同學被冷落時，邀請他加入你們這一組吧。","left out","被冷落、被排除在外",""],["Be curious about people who are different from you.","對和你不一樣的人保持好奇。","curious","好奇的",""],["Don't count your chickens before they are hatched.","別高興得太早（小雞還沒孵出來，別先數有幾隻）。","hatched","孵化（hatch 的過去分詞）","Proverb"],["The road may be long, but every step brings you closer.","路也許很長，但每一步都讓你更接近目標。","closer","更接近的",""],["Keep a notebook of your mistakes; it may become your best teacher.","準備一本錯題筆記，它可能會成為你最好的老師。","notebook","筆記本",""],["Learn to tell the difference between what is urgent and what is important.","學會分辨什麼是緊急的事，什麼是重要的事。","urgent","緊急的",""],["Stand up for someone who is being treated unfairly.","為受到不公平對待的人挺身而出。","Stand up for","挺身支持、捍衛",""],["Write down your dream, and it starts to become a real plan.","把夢想寫下來，它就開始變成真正的計畫。","Write down","寫下",""],["Study a little every day, and you will be surprised at how far you can go.","每天讀一點書，你會驚訝自己能走得多遠。","surprised","驚訝的",""],["Even on hard days, do one small thing for your goal.","即使在辛苦的日子裡，也為你的目標做一件小事。","goal","目標",""],["One poor score does not make you a poor student.","一次分數不理想，不代表你是個差勁的學生。","score","分數",""],["At the end of each week, look back at what worked and what didn't.","每週結束時，回顧一下哪些方法有效、哪些沒效。","worked","奏效；行得通",""],["Being kind to someone who is rude takes real courage.","對無禮的人依然友善，需要真正的勇氣。","rude","無禮的、粗魯的",""],["You don't need every answer before you begin your journey.","在踏上旅程之前，你不需要知道所有的答案。","begin your journey","展開你的旅程",""],["Turn off your phone for thirty minutes and see how much you can finish.","關掉手機三十分鐘，看看你能完成多少。","Turn off","關掉",""],["You have survived every hard day so far, and you will survive this one too.","到目前為止，你撐過了每一個難熬的日子，今天你也一定撐得過去。","survived","撐過；度過",""],["When you get something wrong, ask why, not who to blame.","當你做錯時，該問的是「為什麼」，而不是「該怪誰」。","blame","責怪；歸咎",""],["Being on time shows respect for others and for yourself.","準時，是對別人也是對自己的尊重。","respect","尊重",""],["Treat animals with care; they feel pain and joy just like us.","用心對待動物，牠們跟我們一樣會感到痛苦和快樂。","with care","小心地、用心地",""],["Your future self will thank you for the studying you do today.","未來的你，會感謝今天努力讀書的自己。","future self","未來的自己",""],["Make a plan, follow it, and change it when you need to.","訂好計畫、照著執行，需要時再調整。","follow","遵循、照著做",""],["Giving up is easy; holding on is what makes you strong.","放棄很容易，堅持下去才會讓你變強。","holding on","堅持下去",""],["Admitting a mistake takes more courage than hiding it.","承認錯誤比隱藏錯誤更需要勇氣。","Admitting","承認（admit 的動名詞）",""],["Give each hour a job, and your day will not slip away.","替每個小時安排好任務，你的一天就不會白白溜走。","slip away","溜走；悄悄流逝",""],["Volunteering is a wonderful way to meet people and help your community.","當志工是認識新朋友、幫助社區的好方法。","community","社區",""],["A dream without action is just a wish.","沒有行動的夢想，只是一個願望。","action","行動",""],["A good night's sleep helps your brain remember what you studied.","一夜好眠，能幫助大腦記住你讀過的內容。","remember","記住",""],["The pain of studying is temporary, but what you learn stays with you.","讀書的辛苦是暫時的，但你學到的東西會一直留在你身上。","temporary","暫時的",""],["Your brain is like a muscle: the more you use it, the stronger it gets.","你的大腦就像肌肉，用得越多就會越強壯。","muscle","肌肉",""],["Turn off notifications while you study, and watch your focus grow.","讀書時關掉通知，看看你的專注力如何提升。","notifications","通知",""],["Pick up litter even when no one is watching.","即使沒有人在看，也順手撿起地上的垃圾吧。","litter","（亂丟的）垃圾",""],["Stay curious, because every answer leads to a better question.","保持好奇，因為每個答案都會引出更好的問題。","leads to","導向；引出",""],["Don't just read your notes; test yourself on them.","不要只是看筆記，要拿它們來考考自己。","test yourself","自我測驗",""],["Keep going; the view from the top is worth every step.","繼續前進吧，山頂的風景值得你走的每一步。","view","景色；風景",""],["Instead of saying \"I can't,\" try saying \"I can't yet.\"","與其說「我做不到」，不如試著說「我還做不到」。","Instead of","而不是；代替",""],["When your mind wanders, gently bring it back to the page.","當思緒飄走時，溫柔地把它拉回書頁上。","wanders","（思緒）飄走；漫遊",""],["The best gifts don't come in boxes; they come from the heart.","最好的禮物不是裝在盒子裡，而是發自內心。","come from","來自",""],["It's okay to feel nervous before a big adventure.","在展開一場大冒險之前感到緊張，是很正常的。","nervous","緊張的",""],["Set a timer, study hard, and then take a short break.","設好計時器，認真讀書，然後短暫休息一下。","timer","計時器",""],["Exam results show where you are now, not where you will end up.","考試成績顯示的是你現在的位置，而不是你最後會走到哪裡。","end up","最後成為；最終處於",""],["Growth begins at the end of your comfort zone.","成長始於舒適圈的盡頭。","comfort zone","舒適圈",""],["Your attention is valuable, so spend it on things that help you grow.","你的注意力很寶貴，把它花在能讓你成長的事情上。","attention","注意力",""],["Wherever there is a human being, there is an opportunity for a kindness.","只要有人的地方，就有行善的機會。","opportunity","機會","Seneca"],["Travel light, and leave room in your bag for new memories.","輕裝旅行，在行李裡為新的回憶留點空間。","leave room","留出空間",""],["Don't wait for motivation; just start, and the motivation will follow.","別等動力出現；先開始行動，動力自然會跟上。","motivation","動力",""],["Your future self will thank you for the work you do today.","未來的你，會感謝今天努力的自己。","future self","未來的自己",""],["Struggle is a normal part of learning anything worth knowing.","學習任何值得學的東西時，遇到困難都是正常的。","Struggle","掙扎；吃力的努力",""],["Find a quiet place to study, and half the battle is already won.","找個安靜的地方讀書，就已經成功一半了。","half the battle","成功的一半；最關鍵的一步",""],["Be someone's sunshine on a cloudy day.","在陰天裡，當別人的陽光吧。","cloudy","多雲的、陰天的",""],["Every sunrise brings a new chance to move closer to your dream.","每一次日出，都帶來一個更接近夢想的新機會。","sunrise","日出",""],["Being consistent is more important than being perfect.","持之以恆，比追求完美更重要。","consistent","始終如一的、持續的",""],["Even a small effort is better than no effort at all.","再小的努力，也比完全不努力好。","effort","努力",""],["Hard work is never wasted, even when results come slowly.","努力永遠不會白費，即使成果來得很慢。","wasted","浪費的；白費的",""],["Keep your eyes on your goal, not on the people around you.","把目光放在你的目標上，而不是身邊的人。","Keep your eyes on","專注於；目光放在",""],["A little patience with others can prevent a lot of arguments.","對別人多一點耐心，就能避免很多爭吵。","prevent","預防、避免",""],["Look up at the stars and imagine what you could become.","抬頭看看星星，想像你可能成為什麼樣的人。","imagine","想像",""],["Preparing for an exam is more like a marathon than a sprint.","準備考試比較像跑馬拉松，而不是短跑衝刺。","marathon","馬拉松",""],["A teacher can open the door, but you must walk through it yourself.","老師可以為你打開門，但你必須自己走進去。","walk through","走過；穿過",""],["The hardest days are often the days you grow the most.","最艱難的日子，往往就是你成長最多的日子。","hardest","最困難的",""],["Do one thing at a time, and do it well.","一次只做一件事，並把它做好。","at a time","一次；每次",""],["Share your umbrella on a rainy day, and you may gain a friend.","下雨天和別人共撐一把傘，你可能就多了一個朋友。","gain","獲得",""],["Don't compare your journey with anyone else's; everyone has a different path.","別拿你的旅程和別人比較；每個人都有不同的道路。","compare","比較",""],["The effort you make today will become your confidence tomorrow.","你今天付出的努力，會成為明天的自信。","confidence","自信",""],["Dreams become real only when you start working on them.","夢想只有在你開始為它努力時，才會成真。","working on","致力於；努力做",""],["Learning never stops, and neither should you.","學習永不停止，你也不該停下腳步。","neither","也不",""],["Write down distracting thoughts and come back to them after you finish studying.","把讓你分心的念頭寫下來，讀完書再回頭處理。","distracting","讓人分心的",""],["Help an elderly neighbor carry heavy bags up the stairs.","幫年長的鄰居把沉重的袋子提上樓吧。","elderly","年長的",""],["Reading is a way to travel without leaving your room.","閱讀是一種不用離開房間就能旅行的方式。","without leaving","不用離開",""],["Mistakes are not failures; they show you what to study next.","錯誤不是失敗，而是告訴你接下來該加強什麼。","failures","失敗（的事）",""],["Natural talent may help you start, but effort helps you finish.","天分也許能幫你起步，但努力才能讓你走到終點。","talent","天分；才能",""],["Stay curious and ask why; questions help your mind grow.","保持好奇心，多問為什麼，問題能幫助你的頭腦成長。","curious","好奇的",""],["Your phone can wait; your future cannot.","手機可以等，你的未來不能等。","future","未來",""],["Remember the names of the people you meet; it shows you care.","記住你認識的人的名字，這代表你在乎他們。","shows","顯示、表示",""],["Great discoveries often begin with one simple question: \"Why?\"","偉大的發現，常常始於一個簡單的問題：為什麼？","discoveries","發現（複數）",""],["Keep a notebook of your mistakes and read it before the exam.","準備一本錯題筆記本，考前拿出來複習。","notebook","筆記本",""],["If you sweat now, you will smile on exam day.","現在肯流汗，考試那天你就能微笑。","sweat","流汗",""],["Your effort today is an investment in your future.","你今天的努力，是對未來的投資。","investment","投資",""],["A clean desk helps create a clear mind.","乾淨的書桌，有助於帶來清晰的思緒。","clear","清楚的；清晰的",""],["Don't judge people before you know their story.","在了解別人的故事之前，不要隨便評斷他們。","judge","評斷、批評",""],["Try something new this week, even if it is just a new road home.","這週試試新的事物吧，即使只是換一條回家的路。","even if","即使",""],["Don't compare yourself with others; compare yourself with who you were yesterday.","不要和別人比，要和昨天的自己比。","compare","比較",""],["Effort is never wasted, even when results come slowly.","努力從來不會白費，即使成果來得很慢。","wasted","浪費的；白費的",""],["Don't try to beat others; try to beat the person you were yesterday.","別想著打敗別人，試著超越昨天的自己。","beat","打敗；勝過",""],["Ask yourself often whether what you are doing now moves you toward your goal.","常常問問自己：現在做的事，是否讓你更接近目標？","Ask yourself","問問自己",""],["Cheer for your classmates, not just for yourself.","為同學加油，而不只是為自己打氣。","Cheer for","為……加油",""],["Living abroad, even for a short time, can change how you see home.","即使只是短暫住在國外，也能改變你看待家鄉的方式。","abroad","在國外",""],["Believe in yourself as much as your teachers and family believe in you.","像老師和家人相信你那樣，好好相信你自己。","believe in","相信、信任",""],["Just do your best today; that is always enough.","今天盡力就好，這樣永遠都足夠了。","do your best","盡力；盡全力",""],["A positive attitude turns problems into chances to learn.","積極的態度能把問題變成學習的機會。","attitude","態度",""],["Close the extra tabs on your screen and in your mind.","關掉螢幕上和腦海裡多餘的分頁。","tabs","（瀏覽器的）分頁",""],["A friend in need is a friend indeed.","患難見真情。","in need","在困難中、有需要時","Proverb"],["Courage does not mean having no fear; it means moving forward anyway.","勇氣不是毫無畏懼，而是即使害怕仍繼續前進。","Courage","勇氣",""],["When you feel tired, remember why you started.","覺得累的時候，想想自己當初為什麼開始。","tired","疲累的",""],["True champions are built during the hours when no one is watching.","真正的冠軍，是在沒有人看見的時間裡練成的。","champions","冠軍",""],["Talent is a starting point, but effort takes you the rest of the way.","天分只是起點，努力才能帶你走完剩下的路。","starting point","起點",""],["A study buddy can help you stay focused and on track.","讀書夥伴能幫助你保持專注、走在正軌上。","on track","在正軌上；按計畫進行",""],["The only way to have a friend is to be one.","擁有朋友的唯一方法，就是先成為別人的朋友。","only way","唯一的方法","Ralph Waldo Emerson"],["Set goals that are big enough to excite you and scare you a little.","設定大到讓你興奮、又有點害怕的目標。","excite","使興奮",""],["Take a deep breath; you have prepared for this moment.","深呼吸，你已經為這一刻做好準備了。","deep breath","深呼吸",""],["The more you practice, the easier it gets.","練習得越多，事情就會變得越容易。","practice","練習",""],["Every skill you have now was once something you couldn't do.","你現在擁有的每項技能，都曾經是你做不到的事。","skill","技能",""],["A good habit takes time to build, but it pays you back every day.","好習慣需要時間養成，但它每天都會回報你。","pays you back","回報你",""],["Be slow in choosing a friend, slower in changing.","選擇朋友要慢，更換朋友要更慢。","choosing","選擇","Benjamin Franklin"],["Every person you meet knows something you don't, so be ready to learn.","你遇到的每個人都懂一些你不懂的事，所以要隨時準備好學習。","be ready to","準備好去做……",""],["Read every question carefully before you choose an answer.","選答案之前，先仔細讀完每一道題目。","carefully","仔細地",""],["Great things take time, so be patient with yourself.","偉大的事需要時間，所以對自己要有耐心。","patient","有耐心的",""],["Feedback is a gift, so listen to it with an open mind.","別人給的意見是一份禮物，所以要用開放的心去傾聽。","Feedback","回饋；意見",""],["Make your bed every morning, and start the day with a small win.","每天早上整理床鋪，用一個小小的勝利開啟新的一天。","win","勝利；成功",""],["A good friend listens to you and also tells you the truth.","好朋友會傾聽你，也會對你說實話。","truth","實話、真相",""],["An open mind is the best thing to pack for any trip.","開放的心胸，是任何旅行最值得帶上的東西。","open mind","開放的心胸",""],["If a question is too hard, skip it and come back later.","題目太難就先跳過，等一下再回來作答。","skip","跳過",""],["Patience and practice can turn a weakness into a strength.","耐心加上練習，能把弱點變成強項。","weakness","弱點",""],["Growth is not always easy, but it is always worth it.","成長不一定容易，但永遠值得。","worth it","值得",""],["To build a new habit, link it to something you already do every day.","想養成新習慣，就把它和你每天本來就在做的事連結起來。","link","連結；連接",""],["Don't be afraid to say sorry to a friend first.","別害怕先向朋友道歉。","say sorry","道歉",""],["Dream without limits, and then work hard to make your dreams real.","做夢時不要設限，然後努力讓夢想成真。","limits","限制；極限",""],["Check your answers twice; small mistakes can cost you a lot of points.","答案要檢查兩次，小錯誤可能讓你丟掉很多分。","cost","使損失、使付出代價",""],["Nobody gets it right the first time, and that is perfectly okay.","沒有人第一次就能做對，這完全沒有關係。","perfectly","完全地；十分",""],["Celebrate small wins; they lead to big victories.","為小小的成功慶祝，它們會帶你走向大大的勝利。","victories","勝利（victory 的複數）",""],["Missing one day is fine; just don't let it become two.","錯過一天沒關係，只是別讓它變成兩天。","Missing","錯過",""],["Make time for your friends, even when you are busy.","即使再忙，也要抽出時間陪陪朋友。","Make time","抽出時間",""],["Getting lost in a new city can lead to the best surprises.","在陌生的城市迷路，可能會帶來最棒的驚喜。","Getting lost","迷路",""],["Manage your time well, and every question will get the attention it deserves.","好好分配時間，每一道題目都能得到應有的關注。","deserves","應得",""],["Mistakes are proof that you are trying.","犯錯，證明你正在努力嘗試。","proof","證明；證據",""],["Learning a language takes time, so be patient with yourself.","學語言需要時間，所以對自己多一點耐心。","be patient with","對…有耐心",""],["Every habit begins with a single choice you make today.","每一個習慣，都從你今天做出的一個選擇開始。","single","單一的；一個的",""],["A friend who studies with you makes hard work feel lighter.","有朋友陪你一起讀書，辛苦的努力也會感覺輕鬆一些。","lighter","較輕鬆的、較輕的",""],["If your dream feels too far away, break it into smaller goals.","如果夢想感覺太遙遠，就把它拆成幾個小目標。","break it into","把它分成……",""],["Feeling nervous before a test is normal; turn it into energy.","考前緊張很正常，把它轉化成能量吧。","nervous","緊張的",""],["Every wrong answer you correct today is one less mistake on test day.","今天訂正的每一個錯誤，都會讓考試那天少犯一個錯。","correct","改正；訂正",""],["Don't wait until you feel ready; start now and grow along the way.","別等到覺得準備好了才開始，現在就出發，在過程中成長。","along the way","在過程中；一路上",""],["Learn five new words a day, and you will know more than eighteen hundred in a year.","每天學五個新單字，一年後你就會認識超過一千八百個字。","more than","超過；多於",""],["New friends bring new ideas, while old friends bring comfort.","新朋友帶來新想法，老朋友則帶來安心與自在。","comfort","安心、安慰",""],["Think about what problems you want to solve when you grow up.","想一想長大後你想解決哪些問題。","solve","解決",""],["A single test score cannot measure your hard work or your true value.","一次考試的分數，衡量不了你的努力和真正的價值。","measure","衡量",""],["Be more afraid of never trying than of making mistakes.","比起犯錯，更該害怕的是從來不去嘗試。","afraid of","害怕…",""],["Repeat, review, and remember: that's how real learning happens.","重複、複習、記住：真正的學習就是這樣發生的。","review","複習",""],["Replace a bad habit with a better one instead of just trying to stop.","用更好的習慣取代壞習慣，而不只是努力戒掉它。","Replace","取代；替換",""],["Choose friends who bring out the best in you.","選擇能激發出你最好一面的朋友。","bring out the best","激發出最好的一面",""],["Curiosity turns ordinary days into exciting adventures.","好奇心能把平凡的日子變成精彩的冒險。","ordinary","平凡的；普通的",""],["After the exam, let it go and focus on the next one.","考完一場就放下，專心準備下一場。","let it go","放下",""],["Try to learn from your mistakes, but don't let them stop you.","試著從錯誤中學習，但別讓錯誤阻擋你前進。","learn from","從…中學習",""],["You are not behind; you are simply on your own timeline.","你沒有落後，只是在按照自己的步調前進。","timeline","時間表；時間軸",""],["Keep a habit tracker, and let the check marks motivate you.","用習慣追蹤表記錄，讓一個個打勾激勵你。","motivate","激勵；激發",""],["Distance means little when two friends truly care about each other.","當兩個朋友真心在乎彼此時，距離就不算什麼。","Distance","距離",""],["Every exam you pass brings you one step closer to the life you want.","你通過的每一場考試，都讓你離理想的生活更近一步。","one step closer","更近一步",""],["Practice with past exam papers so the real test feels familiar.","多練習考古題，正式考試時就會覺得更熟悉。","familiar","熟悉的",""],["Make a simple plan and follow it a little every day.","訂一個簡單的計畫，每天照著做一點。","follow","遵循；照著做",""],["Difficult does not mean impossible; it just means you need more time.","困難不代表不可能，只代表你需要更多時間。","impossible","不可能的",""],["Discipline means doing what needs to be done, even when you don't feel like it.","自律就是即使不想做，仍然去做該做的事。","Discipline","自律；紀律",""],["Keep in touch with old friends; they remember who you used to be.","和老朋友保持聯絡，他們記得你從前的樣子。","Keep in touch","保持聯絡",""],["Pack your bag with patience; not every trip goes as planned.","行李中要裝進耐心；不是每趟旅程都會照計畫進行。","patience","耐心",""],["Learn the ideas behind the answers, not just the answers themselves.","要弄懂答案背後的觀念，而不只是記住答案本身。","behind","在……背後",""],["Set small goals you can reach, then reach a little higher.","設定自己能達成的小目標，然後再往上多挑戰一點。","reach","達到；伸手搆到",""],["Tell yourself every morning: \"I can learn anything with effort.\"","每天早上告訴自己：「只要努力，我什麼都學得會。」","effort","努力",""],["Start with just one push-up; small beginnings lead to big changes.","從做一下伏地挺身開始，小小的起步會帶來大大的改變。","beginnings","開始；起步",""],["Celebrate your friends' small wins as if they were your own.","為朋友的小小成就慶祝，就像那是你自己的一樣。","Celebrate","慶祝",""],["The world is full of places waiting for you to discover them.","世界上充滿了等待你去發現的地方。","discover","發現",""],["Count the days left, but make every day count.","倒數剩下的日子，更要讓每一天都有價值。","make every day count","讓每一天都有價值",""],["Put away your phone for thirty minutes and see how much you can get done.","把手機收起來三十分鐘，看看你能完成多少事。","put away","收起來；放好",""],["Read a little English every day, and you will improve without even noticing.","每天讀一點英文，你會在不知不覺中進步。","without even noticing","不知不覺地",""],["The more often you do something, the more natural it feels.","一件事做得越頻繁，就會感覺越自然。","natural","自然的",""],["Trust takes time to build, so be honest with your friends.","信任需要時間建立，所以要對朋友誠實。","Trust","信任",""],["You are never too young to start working toward your dreams.","朝夢想努力，永遠不嫌年紀太小。","toward","朝向；為了",""],["You are stronger than the hardest question on the test.","你比考卷上最難的題目還要強大。","stronger","更強大的",""],["It's better to review a little every night than to cram the night before.","每晚複習一點，勝過考前一晚才臨時抱佛腳。","cram","臨時抱佛腳；死記硬背",""],["Believe in yourself, even when no one else does.","即使沒有人相信你，也要相信你自己。","Believe in","相信",""],["Wake up at the same time every day, even on weekends.","每天在同一時間起床，週末也不例外。","Wake up","醒來；起床",""],["Never be too proud to ask a friend for help.","別因為愛面子，就不好意思向朋友求助。","proud","驕傲的、愛面子的",""],["Every great invention started as someone's crazy idea.","每項偉大的發明，都始於某個人瘋狂的點子。","invention","發明",""],["Finish strong; the last few weeks can make a big difference.","堅持衝刺到最後，最後這幾週能帶來很大的不同。","make a big difference","帶來很大的不同",""],["When you get stuck, asking for help is a smart move, not a weakness.","遇到瓶頸時，尋求協助是聰明的做法，不是軟弱的表現。","stuck","卡住的；困住的",""],["You become braver every time you try something new.","每次嘗試新事物，你都會變得更勇敢。","braver","更勇敢的",""],["Reward yourself after you finish, not before.","完成之後再獎勵自己，而不是之前。","Reward","獎勵",""],["Two people who disagree can still be good friends.","意見不同的兩個人，依然可以是好朋友。","disagree","意見不合",""],["Meeting people from other cultures helps you understand your own culture better.","認識來自其他文化的人，能幫助你更了解自己的文化。","cultures","文化（複數）",""],["A good book is a quiet teacher that never gets tired.","一本好書，是一位永不疲倦的安靜老師。","quiet","安靜的",""],["A good night's sleep is part of your study plan, too.","一夜好眠，也是讀書計畫的一部分。","good night's sleep","一夜好眠",""],["Speak up in class; your ideas are worth hearing.","在課堂上勇敢發言，你的想法值得被聽見。","Speak up","大聲說出來；發言",""],["Your habits today are shaping the person you will be tomorrow.","你今天的習慣，正在塑造明天的你。","shaping","塑造；形成",""],["Introduce yourself to the new student; you might make a lifelong friend.","向新同學自我介紹吧，你可能會交到一輩子的朋友。","lifelong","終身的、一輩子的",""],["If you never try, you will never know what you are capable of.","如果從不嘗試，你永遠不會知道自己有多少能耐。","capable of","有能力做……",""],["Read what you enjoy, and reading will never feel like homework.","讀你喜歡的東西，閱讀就永遠不會像在寫作業。","enjoy","喜歡、享受",""],["Before bed, write down three new things you learned today.","睡前，寫下今天學到的三件新事物。","write down","寫下；記下",""],["You are capable of more than you think.","你的能力遠比你想像的還要強。","capable of","有能力做…",""],["Before you sleep, think of three good things that happened today.","睡前想一想今天發生的三件好事。","happened","發生",""],["If a friend seems quiet today, ask how they are really doing.","如果朋友今天好像特別安靜，問問他是不是真的還好。","seems","似乎、看起來",""],["Wonder about the world, and you will find amazing answers.","對世界保持好奇，你就會找到驚人的答案。","Wonder about","對……感到好奇",""],["Every article you read makes the next one a little easier.","你讀的每一篇文章，都讓下一篇變得容易一點。","article","文章",""],["Read one short English article every day, and your reading speed will improve.","每天讀一篇英文短文，你的閱讀速度就會進步。","improve","進步；改善",""],["Feeling nervous means you care, and caring is a good thing.","會緊張代表你在乎，而在乎是件好事。","nervous","緊張的",""],["Put your study materials where you can see them, and studying becomes easier.","把讀書資料放在看得見的地方，讀書就會變得更容易。","materials","資料；材料",""],["Friendship is not about how long you've known someone, but how much you care.","友情不在於認識多久，而在於有多在乎。","Friendship","友誼、友情",""],["Replace \"I can't\" with \"I'll try,\" and see how much you can do.","把「我做不到」換成「我試試看」，看看自己能做到多少。","Replace","取代；替換",""],["Reading English news keeps your mind sharp and your vocabulary growing.","閱讀英文新聞，讓你頭腦保持敏銳，字彙量持續增加。","vocabulary","字彙",""],["Listening to a little English every day trains your ears.","每天聽一點英文，就能訓練你的耳朵。","trains","訓練",""],["Be kind to yourself when things go wrong.","事情不順利時，要對自己溫柔一點。","go wrong","出錯；不順利",""],["Staying up late to study often costs you more than it gives you.","熬夜讀書往往得不償失。","Staying up late","熬夜",""],["A problem shared is a problem halved.","有人分擔，煩惱就減半。","shared","分擔的、分享的","Proverb"],["Travel shows you that happiness does not depend on owning many things.","旅行讓你明白，快樂並不取決於擁有多少東西。","depend on","取決於；依賴",""],["Find the main idea first, and the details will make more sense.","先找出主旨，細節就會更容易理解。","main idea","主旨",""],["Study for twenty-five minutes, rest for five, and then do it again.","讀二十五分鐘，休息五分鐘，然後再來一輪。","rest","休息",""],["Hold your head high and walk into the exam room with a smile.","抬頭挺胸，帶著微笑走進考場。","Hold your head high","抬頭挺胸",""],["Put away screens an hour before bed, and you'll sleep more deeply.","睡前一小時放下螢幕，你會睡得更沉。","screens","螢幕",""],["Be the kind of friend who remembers birthdays and small details.","當一個會記得生日和小細節的朋友。","details","細節",""],["Respect local customs wherever you go, and people will welcome you.","無論走到哪裡都尊重當地習俗，人們就會歡迎你。","customs","習俗",""],["Books let you travel the world without leaving your chair.","書本讓你不用離開椅子，就能環遊世界。","travel","旅行",""],["Keep a small notebook for new words, and look at it every day.","準備一本小筆記本記新單字，每天都拿出來看一看。","notebook","筆記本",""],["A calm mind can solve problems that a worried mind cannot.","冷靜的頭腦，能解決焦慮的頭腦解決不了的問題。","calm","冷靜的",""],["Rest is not laziness; it is part of the work.","休息不是懶惰，而是努力的一部分。","laziness","懶惰",""],["A good friend will accept you just as you are.","好朋友會接納真實的你。","accept","接受、接納",""],["Your hobbies today might become your career tomorrow.","你今天的興趣，可能成為你明天的職業。","career","職業；生涯",""],["Good readers often become good writers, so keep reading.","好的讀者往往也會成為好的寫作者，所以要持續閱讀。","writers","寫作者、作家",""],["Reading aloud for five minutes a day helps your English sound more natural.","每天朗讀五分鐘，能讓你的英文聽起來更自然。","aloud","出聲地；大聲地",""],["Confidence is not knowing every answer; it is being willing to try.","自信不是知道每個答案，而是願意去嘗試。","willing to","願意",""],["A short break can turn a bad study day into a good one.","短暫的休息，能把不順的讀書日變成美好的一天。","break","休息；暫停",""],["Home is where the heart is.","心之所在，即是家。","heart","心","Proverb"],["Believe that something wonderful is about to happen.","相信美好的事情即將發生。","is about to","即將；正要",""],["Reading aloud helps you hear the music of English.","大聲朗讀，能幫助你聽見英文的節奏與韻律。","aloud","大聲地、出聲地",""],["Each practice test shows you exactly what to work on next.","每一份模擬考，都會清楚告訴你接下來要加強什麼。","practice test","模擬考",""],["Focus on what you can control, and let go of the rest.","專注於你能掌控的事，其餘的就放下吧。","let go of","放下；放手",""],["Listen to your body; when it says it's tired, let it rest.","傾聽你的身體，當它說累了，就讓它休息。","Listen to","傾聽；聽從",""],["Tell your parents you love them; they never get tired of hearing it.","告訴爸媽你愛他們，他們永遠聽不膩。","get tired of","對……感到厭倦",""],["Explore with your eyes, your ears, and your heart.","用你的眼睛、耳朵和心去探索。","Explore","探索",""],["A single sentence in a book can change the way you think.","書中的一句話，就可能改變你的思考方式。","the way you think","你的思考方式",""],["Write your goal on a sticky note and put it where you can see it.","把目標寫在便利貼上，貼在你看得到的地方。","sticky note","便利貼",""],["Don't listen to the voice that says you aren't good enough.","別理會那個說你不夠好的聲音。","good enough","夠好的",""],["Your eyes need rest too, so look out the window now and then.","眼睛也需要休息，所以不時望向窗外吧。","now and then","偶爾；不時",""],["Helping with the housework is a simple way to show your family you care.","幫忙做家事，是向家人表達關心的簡單方式。","housework","家事",""],["No dream is too small if it gives your life meaning.","只要能讓人生有意義，再小的夢想都不嫌小。","meaning","意義",""],["Learning a new language opens doors you never knew existed.","學習一種新語言，會為你打開許多你從不知道的大門。","existed","存在（exist 的過去式）",""],["Finish one small task first, and the next one will feel easier.","先完成一件小任務，下一件就會感覺容易多了。","task","任務；工作",""],["Your dreams are worth every early morning and every hour of hard work.","你的夢想，值得你每一次早起、每一小時的努力。","dreams","夢想（dream 的複數）",""],["Take a short walk when you feel stuck; fresh air brings fresh ideas.","卡住的時候就去散散步，新鮮空氣會帶來新的想法。","fresh air","新鮮空氣",""],["Eat dinner with your family whenever you can; those moments matter.","盡可能和家人一起吃晚餐，那些時光很重要。","whenever","每當、無論何時",""],["The best investment you can make is in your own education.","你能做的最好投資，就是投資自己的教育。","investment","投資",""],["Learn five new words a day, and you will know hundreds by exam day.","一天學五個新單字，到考試時你就會認識好幾百個。","hundreds","數以百計",""],["A short walk can clear your mind when studying feels too hard.","讀書讀得太吃力時，出去散個步能讓頭腦清醒一下。","clear your mind","讓頭腦清醒",""],["Walk into every challenge as if you belong there, because you do.","迎向每個挑戰時，要相信自己屬於那裡，因為你真的屬於。","belong","屬於",""],["A quiet weekend morning can recharge you for the whole week.","一個安靜的週末早晨，能讓你為整個星期充飽電。","recharge","充電；恢復精力",""],["Your grandparents' stories are treasures, so listen to them carefully.","爺爺奶奶的故事是寶藏，要用心聆聽。","treasures","寶藏、珍寶",""],["Step outside your comfort zone; that is where growth begins.","走出你的舒適圈，那裡才是成長的起點。","comfort zone","舒適圈",""],["Don't be afraid to speak English; every conversation makes you braver.","別害怕說英文，每一次對話都會讓你更勇敢。","conversation","對話",""],["Don't wait for motivation; build a habit instead.","別等動力出現，去養成習慣吧。","motivation","動力；動機",""],["It's okay to be shy; small brave moments will slowly change you.","害羞沒關係，一個個小小的勇敢時刻會慢慢改變你。","shy","害羞的",""],["Even a twenty-minute nap can make your afternoon brighter.","即使只是小睡二十分鐘，也能讓你的下午更有精神。","nap","小睡；午睡",""],["A warm hug from your family can fix almost any bad day.","家人一個溫暖的擁抱，幾乎能讓任何糟糕的一天好起來。","hug","擁抱",""],["The world needs your ideas, so don't keep them to yourself.","世界需要你的想法，所以別把它們藏在心裡。","keep them to yourself","藏在心裡；不說出來",""],["English songs are a fun way to improve your listening.","聽英文歌，是提升聽力的有趣方法。","improve","提升、改善",""],["Good habits grow quietly, one ordinary day after another.","好習慣是在一個又一個平凡的日子裡，悄悄養成的。","ordinary","平凡的；普通的",""],["You are stronger than the problem in front of you.","你比眼前的問題更強大。","in front of","在…前面",""],["Make time for hobbies; they keep your heart young and your mind fresh.","抽出時間培養嗜好，它們能讓你的心保持年輕、頭腦保持清新。","Make time for","為……騰出時間；抽空做……",""],["Be patient with your younger brothers and sisters; they look up to you.","對弟弟妹妹要有耐心，他們都把你當作榜樣。","look up to","尊敬、仰慕",""],["On tired days, remind yourself why you started.","疲憊的日子裡，提醒自己當初為什麼出發。","remind","提醒",""],["Grammar is the map that helps your words find their way.","文法就像地圖，幫助你的字句找到方向。","Grammar","文法",""],["The hardest part is often getting started, so just begin.","最難的往往是開始，所以就先動手吧。","getting started","開始著手",""],["Remember a time you did something you once feared; you can do it again.","回想你曾經克服恐懼、完成某件事的時刻，你一定能再做到一次。","feared","害怕（fear 的過去式）",""],["A healthy breakfast gives your brain the energy it needs to learn.","健康的早餐，提供大腦學習所需的能量。","energy","能量；精力",""],["Your parents' rules often come from love, not control.","爸媽的規定往往出於愛，而不是想控制你。","control","控制",""],["A simple \"hello\" in the local language can make a stranger smile.","用當地語言說一聲簡單的「你好」，就能讓陌生人露出微笑。","stranger","陌生人",""],["Watch English videos with subtitles, and your ears will slowly get used to the sounds.","看附有字幕的英文影片，你的耳朵會慢慢習慣這些聲音。","get used to","習慣於",""],["Do it now, even if you only have ten minutes.","現在就做，即使你只有十分鐘。","even if","即使",""],["A strong heart is built by facing hard things, not by avoiding them.","堅強的心，是靠面對困難練出來的，而不是靠逃避。","avoiding","逃避；避免",""],["Drink water often; even mild thirst can make it harder to think.","常常喝水，即使只是輕微口渴，也會讓思考變得更困難。","thirst","口渴",""],["Call your grandparents this weekend; your voice will make them smile.","這個週末打通電話給爺爺奶奶吧，你的聲音會讓他們笑開懷。","voice","聲音",""],["Keep a notebook for your questions, and look for answers every week.","準備一本筆記本記下你的疑問，每週去找答案。","look for","尋找",""],["A word you use is a word you own.","真正用過的單字，才是屬於你的單字。","own","擁有",""],["Believe that you can improve, and you have already taken the first step.","相信自己能進步，你就已經踏出了第一步。","first step","第一步",""],["Saying positive things to yourself can change how you perform.","對自己說正面的話，能改變你的表現。","perform","表現",""],["Stand up and stretch after every hour of sitting.","每坐一小時，就站起來伸展一下。","stretch","伸展",""],["Small family traditions create memories that last a lifetime.","小小的家庭傳統，會創造出一輩子的回憶。","traditions","傳統",""],["Don't just dream about the world; go out and see it.","別只是夢想著這個世界，走出去親眼看看吧。","go out","出去；外出",""],["Write a few lines in English every day, even about simple things.","每天用英文寫幾行字，就算只是簡單的小事也好。","simple","簡單的",""],["Your brain grows stronger every time you work through a hard problem.","每次努力解開一道難題，你的大腦都會變得更強。","work through","努力解決；一步步完成",""],["Everyone shines in a different way, and so do you.","每個人都以不同的方式發光，你也是。","shines","發光；表現出色",""],["Thirty minutes of exercise a day keeps both body and mind strong.","每天運動三十分鐘，讓身心都保持強健。","exercise","運動",""],["The love of a family is one of life's greatest blessings.","家人的愛是人生中最大的福氣之一。","blessings","祝福、福氣",""],["Practice a little English every day, and the world will feel closer.","每天練習一點英文，世界就會感覺更近一些。","Practice","練習",""],["Think in English for one minute a day and watch your fluency grow.","每天用英文思考一分鐘，看著你的流利度慢慢成長。","fluency","流利度",""],["Real confidence comes from practice, not from luck.","真正的自信來自練習，而不是運氣。","confidence","自信；信心",""],["Each page you study today makes the road to your exam smoother.","你今天讀的每一頁，都讓通往考試的路更加平順。","smoother","更平順的",""],["Eat more fruit and vegetables, and your body will thank you.","多吃蔬菜水果，你的身體會感謝你。","vegetables","蔬菜",""],["Respect your elders; they have walked the road you are walking now.","尊敬長輩，他們走過你現在正在走的路。","elders","長輩",""],["Many of today's dreamers will become tomorrow's leaders.","今天的許多夢想家，將成為明天的領袖。","leaders","領袖；領導者",""],["English is more than a school subject; it is a tool you will use for life.","英文不只是學校的一個科目，更是你一輩子都會用到的工具。","tool","工具",""],["Feeling uncomfortable often means you are learning something new.","感到不自在，常常代表你正在學新的東西。","uncomfortable","不自在的；不舒服的",""],["Every exam is a chance to show how much you have grown.","每次考試，都是展現你成長了多少的機會。","grown","成長（grow 的過去分詞）",""],["Sitting up straight helps you breathe better and stay alert.","坐直身體，能幫助你呼吸更順暢、保持清醒。","alert","警覺的；清醒的",""],["Siblings can be your first and longest-lasting friends.","兄弟姊妹可能是你最早、也最長久的朋友。","Siblings","兄弟姊妹",""],["Not knowing something is okay, as long as you are willing to learn.","不懂某件事沒關係，只要你願意學習就好。","willing","願意的",""],["Every language learner feels lost at first, so be patient with yourself.","每個學語言的人一開始都會感到迷惘，所以對自己要有耐心。","patient","有耐心的",""],["Be kind to yourself on slow days; you are still moving forward.","在進展緩慢的日子裡，對自己溫柔一點，你仍然在前進。","moving forward","向前邁進",""],["Each new English word you learn opens a door to a bigger world.","你學會的每個英文單字，都為你打開一扇通往更大世界的門。","opens a door","打開一扇門；開啟機會",""],["Too much sugar gives you quick energy and a quick crash.","吃太多糖，精神來得快，垮得也快。","crash","（精力）驟降；崩潰",""],["Cooking a simple meal for your family is a gift of love.","為家人煮一頓簡單的飯，就是一份愛的禮物。","meal","一餐、餐點",""],["Your passion can take you to places you never imagined.","你的熱情能帶你到從未想像過的地方。","passion","熱情",""],["Words are like seeds; review them often, and they will grow.","單字就像種子，經常複習，它們就會發芽成長。","seeds","種子",""],["Don't compare your first chapter with someone else's tenth chapter.","別拿你的第一章，去跟別人的第十章比較。","compare","比較",""],["Sleep well before the exam; a rested brain remembers more.","考前好好睡一覺，休息充足的大腦能記得更多。","rested","休息充足的",""],["Eating slowly helps you enjoy your food and feel full sooner.","慢慢吃，能讓你好好享受食物，也更快有飽足感。","full","飽的",""],["Remember that your parents were once teenagers with dreams, too.","別忘了，你的爸媽也曾是懷抱夢想的青少年。","teenagers","青少年",""],["Success is not a single destination; it is many small wins along the road.","成功不是單一的終點，而是一路上許多小小的勝利。","destination","目的地；終點",""],["A dictionary is a good friend, but context is an even better one.","字典是好朋友，但上下文是更好的朋友。","context","上下文、語境",""],["Progress, not perfection, is what really matters.","真正重要的是進步，而不是完美。","perfection","完美",""],["Reading English aloud helps you speak with more confidence.","大聲朗讀英文，能幫助你更有自信地開口說。","aloud","大聲地；出聲地",""],["Moving your body is one of the fastest ways to lift your mood.","動一動身體，是提振心情最快的方法之一。","mood","心情",""],["Every family has its problems; what matters is facing them together.","每個家庭都有問題，重要的是一起面對。","facing","面對",""],["Learning never ends, and that is the most exciting part.","學習永無止境，而這正是最令人興奮的地方。","never ends","永不結束",""],["Teaching others is one of the best ways to learn.","教別人，是最好的學習方法之一。","one of the best","最好的……之一",""],["Learning English is a marathon, not a sprint.","學英文是一場馬拉松，不是短跑衝刺。","marathon","馬拉松",""],["Every grammar rule you master makes the next one easier.","你掌握的每一條文法規則，都會讓下一條更容易。","master","精通；掌握",""],["Get some sunlight every day; it helps you sleep better at night.","每天曬點太陽，晚上能睡得更好。","sunlight","陽光",""],["No matter how old you are, your parents still worry about you.","不管你幾歲，爸媽還是會擔心你。","worry about","擔心",""],["Your dreams are the blueprint for the life you will build.","你的夢想，就是你將建立的人生藍圖。","blueprint","藍圖",""],["Copy one beautiful English sentence a day and learn it by heart.","每天抄一句優美的英文句子，並把它背熟。","by heart","背熟、牢記",""],["Success often comes to people who simply keep showing up.","成功往往屬於那些持續出現、從不缺席的人。","showing up","出現；到場",""],["Don't fear long reading passages; take them one paragraph at a time.","別害怕長篇閱讀，一次讀一段就好。","paragraph","段落",""],["Wash your hands often; it is a simple way to stay healthy.","勤洗手，是保持健康的簡單方法。","stay healthy","保持健康",""],["Forgiving family members is hard, but it brings peace to your home.","原諒家人並不容易，但能為家裡帶來平靜。","peace","平靜、和平",""],["Keep going; the best part of the story may be the next chapter.","繼續前進吧，故事最精彩的部分可能就在下一章。","chapter","章節",""],["Don't worry about your accent; clear meaning is what counts.","別擔心口音，把意思說清楚才是重點。","accent","口音",""],["Some days you will fly, and some days you will crawl; both count.","有些日子你會飛，有些日子你只能爬，但兩者都算數。","count","算數；有價值",""],["Count down the days, but also count how much you have learned.","倒數考試的日子，也別忘了數數自己學會了多少。","Count down","倒數",""],["Choose the stairs instead of the elevator, and turn daily life into exercise.","選擇走樓梯而不是搭電梯，讓日常生活變成運動。","stairs","樓梯",""],["Your family's support can give you the confidence to try new things.","家人的支持，能給你嘗試新事物的自信。","support","支持",""],["Each new skill you learn is a ticket to a new opportunity.","你學會的每項新技能，都是通往新機會的門票。","opportunity","機會",""],["Practice makes perfect, so use your English whenever you can.","熟能生巧，所以一有機會就多用英文吧。","whenever","每當、無論何時",""],["The countdown is not a threat; it is a reminder to use today well.","倒數計時不是威脅，而是提醒你好好把握今天。","reminder","提醒",""],["If one way of studying doesn't work, try a different one.","如果一種讀書方法沒效，就換個方法試試。","work","（方法）奏效；有用",""],["Good health is the foundation for every dream you chase.","良好的健康，是你追逐每一個夢想的基礎。","foundation","基礎；根基",""],["Even when you are far from home, your family's love goes with you.","即使離家很遠，家人的愛也一直陪著你。","far from","離……很遠",""],["Ask for directions when you're lost; asking for help is a sign of wisdom.","迷路時就問路；開口求助是有智慧的表現。","wisdom","智慧",""],["Learning never stops, even after the exam is over.","即使考試結束了，學習也永遠不會停止。","even after","即使在……之後",""],["See obstacles as steps to climb, not walls that stop you.","把障礙看成可以攀爬的階梯，而不是擋住你的牆。","obstacles","障礙",""],["Explaining a lesson to a friend helps you understand it better.","把學過的內容解釋給朋友聽，能幫助你理解得更透徹。","Explaining","解釋（explain 的動名詞）",""],["Skipping meals to save time will only slow you down later.","為了省時間而不吃飯，之後只會拖慢你的腳步。","Skipping","略過；不吃（餐）",""],["Gratitude turns an ordinary day into a special one.","感恩的心，能讓平凡的一天變得特別。","ordinary","平凡的、普通的",""],["Your hometown is where you begin, not where you must end.","家鄉是你的起點，而不是你必須停留的終點。","hometown","家鄉",""],["Stay curious, and every lesson will feel like a discovery.","保持好奇心，每一堂課都會像一次新發現。","discovery","發現",""],["If the plan doesn't work, change the plan, not the goal.","如果計畫行不通，就改變計畫，而不是改變目標。","plan","計畫",""],["Write down one thing you learned today, no matter how small.","寫下今天學到的一件事，不管它有多小。","no matter how","無論多麼",""],["Laughing with friends can melt away the stress of a long day.","和朋友一起大笑，能化解漫長一天的壓力。","melt away","消散；融化",""],["Count your blessings, not your problems.","數算你擁有的幸福，而不是你的煩惱。","Count your blessings","細數自己的福氣、知足惜福",""],["Stop asking \"What if?\" and start asking \"Why not?\"","別再問「萬一……怎麼辦？」，開始問「為什麼不試試？」","What if","萬一……怎麼辦",""],["No one can take away what you have learned.","你學到的東西，沒有人能奪走。","take away","奪走、拿走",""],["You can't change yesterday, but you can still make today count.","你無法改變昨天，但仍然可以讓今天過得有意義。","change","改變",""],["Set a clear goal, and let it guide you through tough days.","設定一個清楚的目標，讓它帶領你度過艱難的日子。","guide","引導；帶領",""],["Worrying about tomorrow only takes away today's peace.","為明天擔憂，只會奪走今天的平靜。","takes away","奪走；帶走",""],["Write down three good things that happened to you today.","寫下今天發生在你身上的三件好事。","Write down","寫下",""],["Every museum, market, and street corner has a story to tell.","每座博物館、每個市場和每個街角，都有一個故事要訴說。","museum","博物館",""],["Learning is easier when you connect new ideas to things you already know.","把新觀念和已知的事物連結起來，學習會更容易。","connect","連結",""],["There's no shame in starting over; it's a chance to do it better.","重新開始並不丟臉，那是把事情做得更好的機會。","starting over","重新開始",""],["Every day you choose to try, you are already winning.","每一天只要你選擇嘗試，你就已經是贏家。","choose","選擇",""],["When stress builds up, write your worries on paper and let them go.","壓力累積時，把煩惱寫在紙上，然後放下它們。","builds up","累積；增加",""],["Be thankful for teachers who believed in you before you believed in yourself.","感謝那些在你相信自己之前，就先相信你的老師。","believed in","相信、信任",""],["Saving a little money now can pay for a big adventure later.","現在存一點錢，以後就能支付一場大冒險。","Saving","儲蓄；存錢",""],["Your brain is like a muscle that gets stronger with exercise.","你的大腦就像肌肉，越鍛鍊越強壯。","muscle","肌肉",""],["Just focus on today's page, not the whole book.","專心讀好今天這一頁就好，不必去想整本書。","focus on","專注於",""],["Don't be afraid to start over; this time you are not starting from zero.","別害怕重新開始，這一次你不是從零開始。","start over","重新開始",""],["Asking for help is a sign of strength, not weakness.","開口求助是堅強的表現，而不是軟弱。","a sign of strength","堅強的表現",""],["When you feel grateful, it's hard to feel unhappy at the same time.","當你心懷感激時，就很難同時感到不快樂。","at the same time","同時",""],["Kindness is understood in every corner of the world.","善意在世界的每個角落都能被理解。","Kindness","善意；仁慈",""],["Be proud of how far you have come, and keep going.","為自己一路走來的進步感到驕傲，然後繼續前進。","proud of","以……為傲",""],["You can't do it yet, and \"yet\" is a very powerful word.","你只是「還沒」做到，而「還沒」是一個非常有力量的詞。","powerful","強而有力的",""],["Don't look for excuses; look for ways to get better.","別找藉口，去找讓自己進步的方法。","excuses","藉口",""],["Balance study with fun, and you will enjoy both more.","在讀書和玩樂之間取得平衡，你會更享受兩者。","Balance","平衡",""],["Don't wait for a special day to thank the people you love.","別等到特別的日子，才感謝你所愛的人。","special","特別的",""],["A dream is a promise you make to yourself.","夢想是你對自己許下的承諾。","promise","承諾",""],["Don't let one difficult chapter stop you from finishing the book.","別讓一個困難的章節，阻止你讀完整本書。","chapter","章節",""],["Find a study partner, and you can push each other forward.","找一個讀書夥伴，你們就能互相督促、一起前進。","push each other","互相督促",""],["The view from the top is worth every step of the climb.","山頂的風景，值得你攀登路上的每一步。","climb","攀登；攀爬",""],["Being well prepared is the best cure for exam worries.","做好充分準備，是消除考試焦慮的最好方法。","well prepared","準備充分的",""],["Appreciate what you have before time teaches you its value.","在時間教會你懂得珍惜之前，先珍惜你所擁有的。","Appreciate","珍惜、感激",""],["Don't be scared of big changes; they often bring big chances.","別害怕重大的改變；它們常常帶來大好的機會。","be scared of","害怕……",""],["Learning is like climbing a mountain; the view gets better as you go higher.","學習就像爬山，爬得越高，風景越美。","climbing","攀爬、爬（山）",""],["Small wins are still wins, so take a moment to celebrate them.","小小的勝利也是勝利，花點時間慶祝一下吧。","celebrate","慶祝",""],["You can't change yesterday, but today is still in your hands.","你無法改變昨天，但今天仍掌握在你手中。","in your hands","掌握在你手中",""],["Spend time with people who make you feel calm and strong.","多和讓你感到平靜又堅強的人相處。","Spend time with","和……相處；陪伴",""],["Even on bad days, there is something small to be grateful for.","即使在不順的日子裡，也總有一些小事值得感恩。","be grateful for","對……心存感激",""],["Learning about history helps you understand where the world is going.","了解歷史，能幫助你明白世界正走向何方。","history","歷史",""],["Patience and practice can turn a weak subject into a strong one.","耐心加上練習，能讓弱科變成強項。","weak","弱的、不擅長的",""],["You can make excuses or make progress, but not both.","你可以找藉口，也可以求進步，但不能兩者兼得。","excuses","藉口",""],["It's not about being the best; it's about doing your best.","重點不是成為最好的，而是盡你最大的努力。","doing your best","盡全力",""],["Look after the basics first: sleep, food, water, and movement.","先照顧好基本需求：睡眠、飲食、喝水和活動。","Look after","照顧；照料",""],["Giving a gift can feel even better than receiving one.","送禮物給別人，感覺可能比收到禮物還要棒。","receiving","收到、接受",""],["Keep your dreams alive by talking about them with people who care.","和關心你的人聊聊夢想，讓它們保持鮮活。","alive","活著的；有活力的",""],["Dream big, then work hard every day to make your dreams come true.","懷抱遠大的夢想，然後每天努力讓夢想成真。","Dream big","懷抱遠大夢想",""],["Spend a little extra time on the subject you like the least.","多花一點時間在你最不喜歡的科目上。","extra","額外的",""],["Feeling stuck is often a sign that you are about to learn something new.","覺得卡關，往往代表你就快要學到新東西了。","stuck","卡住的；困住的",""],["Keep your study space for studying, and your brain will learn to focus there.","讓讀書的地方只用來讀書，你的大腦就會學會在那裡專心。","study space","讀書空間",""],["Gratitude is not only the greatest of virtues, but the parent of all the others.","感恩不僅是最偉大的美德，更是一切美德之母。","virtues","美德","Cicero"],["Trying local food is one of the tastiest ways to learn about a culture.","品嘗當地美食，是認識一種文化最美味的方式之一。","tastiest","最美味的（tasty 的最高級）",""],["Growth happens when you step outside your comfort zone.","走出舒適圈，成長才會發生。","comfort zone","舒適圈",""],["A difficult task is not an impossible one; it simply needs more time.","困難的事並不是不可能的事，只是需要多一點時間。","impossible","不可能的",""],["Being a beginner is nothing to be ashamed of.","當個初學者，沒什麼好丟臉的。","ashamed of","對…感到羞愧",""],["Give yourself a finish time, and your work will not stretch through the whole evening.","替自己訂一個結束時間，工作就不會拖滿整個晚上。","finish time","結束時間",""],["Thank-you notes may be old-fashioned, but they never go out of style.","感謝卡或許有點老派，但永遠不會過時。","go out of style","過時、退流行",""],["Many jobs of the future do not exist yet, so stay curious and keep learning.","許多未來的工作現在還不存在，所以要保持好奇、持續學習。","exist","存在",""],["Be kind to yourself on bad days, and work harder on good ones.","狀態不好時善待自己，狀態好時就再多努力一點。","Be kind to yourself","善待自己",""],["Learning is like a puzzle: every piece you add makes the picture clearer.","學習就像拼圖，每多拼上一片，畫面就更清楚一些。","puzzle","拼圖；謎題",""],["Real confidence grows when you keep the promises you make to yourself.","當你遵守對自己許下的承諾，真正的自信就會慢慢成長。","promises","承諾（promise 的複數）",""],["When you rest, rest fully; when you work, work fully.","休息時就好好休息，工作時就全力以赴。","fully","完全地；充分地",""],["A grateful person finds beauty in places others ignore.","心懷感恩的人，能在別人忽略的地方發現美。","ignore","忽略、不理會",""],["Look at a world map and choose one place you want to visit someday.","看看世界地圖，選一個你將來想去的地方。","someday","總有一天；將來某天",""],["Every expert you admire was once a nervous beginner too.","每一位你欣賞的專家，也都曾是緊張的初學者。","beginner","初學者",""],["Rewrite your notes in your own words, and you will remember them longer.","用自己的話重寫筆記，你會記得更久。","in your own words","用自己的話",""],["Keep speaking even when you make mistakes; fluency comes with time.","就算會犯錯也要繼續開口說，流利度會隨著時間而來。","fluency","流利；流暢度",""],["Your body loves routine, so eat your meals at regular times.","身體喜歡規律，所以要定時吃飯。","regular","規律的；固定的",""],["Be thankful for clean water, warm food, and a safe place to sleep.","感謝乾淨的水、溫熱的食物，還有一個安全的地方可以睡覺。","thankful","感謝的、感激的",""],["Your hard work will speak for itself on exam day.","考試那天，你的努力會證明一切。","speak for itself","不言自明、自己證明",""],["When a reading passage looks too long, take it one paragraph at a time.","閱讀測驗的文章看起來太長時，就一段一段慢慢讀。","paragraph","段落",""],["Your story isn't over just because one chapter was hard.","就算某一章很難熬，你的故事也還沒結束。","chapter","章節",""],["Too much coffee or bubble tea late in the day can keep you awake at night.","下午或傍晚喝太多咖啡或珍珠奶茶，可能會讓你晚上睡不著。","keep you awake","讓你睡不著；使你保持清醒",""],["Saying thank you is easy; meaning it is what makes it powerful.","說謝謝很容易，真心誠意才讓它有力量。","powerful","有力量的、強大的",""],["Write down your goals and put them where you can see them every day.","把目標寫下來，放在每天都看得到的地方。","Write down","寫下",""],["Keep a list of your small successes and read it when you feel down.","把你的小成就列成清單，心情低落時拿出來讀一讀。","feel down","心情低落",""],["What you learn today will stay with you forever.","你今天學到的東西，會永遠跟著你。","forever","永遠",""],["Dinner with your family is time well spent, even in exam season.","即使在考季，和家人一起吃晚餐也是值得花的時間。","time well spent","值得花的時間",""],["The more you thank life, the more reasons it gives you to smile.","你越感謝生活，生活就給你越多微笑的理由。","reasons","理由、原因",""],["Listening carefully is the first step to speaking well.","仔細聆聽，是把英文說好的第一步。","first step","第一步",""],["Good things come to those who work for them, not just to those who wait.","好事會降臨在為它努力的人身上，而不只是那些等待的人。","work for","為…努力",""],["Kind words to a classmate can build their confidence and yours.","對同學說些溫暖的話，能增強他們的自信，也能增強你的。","classmate","同學",""],["Daydreaming for a few minutes lets your tired brain reset.","發呆放空幾分鐘，能讓疲累的大腦重新開機。","reset","重新設定；重新開始",""],["Happiness often hides in small things, like a warm bowl of soup.","幸福常常藏在小事裡，像是一碗熱湯。","hides","隱藏、躲藏",""],["If you feel stuck, try learning the same thing in a different way.","卡關的時候，試著換個方法學同一件事。","stuck","卡住的",""],["It takes courage to try again after a failure, and you have that courage.","失敗後再試一次需要勇氣，而你擁有這份勇氣。","courage","勇氣",""],["Turn your worries into a plan, and they will feel much smaller.","把你的擔憂化成計畫，它們就會顯得小很多。","worries","擔憂；煩惱",""],["A messy week does not ruin your plan; simply adjust it and continue.","一週過得亂七八糟，並不會毀掉你的計畫，只要調整後繼續就好。","adjust","調整",""],["Enjoy the sunshine on your way to school this morning.","今天早上上學途中，好好享受陽光吧。","on your way to","在去……的路上",""],["Learning how to learn is the most useful skill of all.","學會如何學習，是所有技能中最有用的一項。","useful","有用的",""],["Ten minutes of practice is better than ten minutes of worrying.","練習十分鐘，勝過擔心十分鐘。","worrying","擔心；煩惱",""],["A wise person learns from other people's mistakes as well as their own.","聰明的人不只從自己的錯誤中學習，也從別人的錯誤中學習。","as well as","以及；還有",""],["An ounce of prevention is worth a pound of cure.","一分預防勝過十分治療；預防勝於治療。","prevention","預防","Proverb"],["A good laugh with friends works better than any medicine.","和朋友開懷大笑，比任何藥都有效。","medicine","藥",""],["Knowledge is a treasure that grows the more you share it.","知識是一種越分享就越多的寶藏。","treasure","寶藏",""],["Stop asking whether you can do it, and start asking how.","別再問自己做不做得到，開始問該怎麼做到。","whether","是否",""],["Don't let one difficult question shake your confidence for the whole test.","別讓一道難題動搖你整場考試的信心。","shake","動搖",""],["A change is as good as a rest.","換個環境或換件事做，就和休息一樣有效。","as good as","和……一樣好；幾乎等於","Proverb"],["Take a deep breath and enjoy this moment.","深呼吸，享受當下這一刻。","deep breath","深呼吸",""],["Learning English helps you understand other cultures and ways of life.","學英文能幫助你了解其他文化和生活方式。","cultures","文化",""],["When a question looks hard, take a deep breath and read it again slowly.","題目看起來很難時，先深呼吸，再慢慢讀一遍。","deep breath","深呼吸",""],["Strike while the iron is hot.","打鐵趁熱。","Strike","敲打；出擊","Proverb"],["Happiness is not something you buy; it's something you create.","幸福不是用買的，而是自己創造的。","create","創造",""],["Build one good study habit at a time.","一次養成一個好的讀書習慣。","habit","習慣",""],["Don't let one difficult unit make you give up on the whole subject.","別因為一個困難的單元，就放棄整個科目。","give up on","對…放棄",""],["If you burn the candle at both ends, you will soon run out of energy.","蠟燭兩頭燒，很快就會耗盡精力。","run out of","用完；耗盡",""],["Your favorite song can lift your mood in just three minutes.","你最愛的歌，只要三分鐘就能讓你心情變好。","mood","心情",""],["Smile at the exam paper; it is a chance to show what you know.","對考卷微笑吧，這是展現所學的好機會。","show what you know","展現所學",""],["Use small pieces of free time, like waiting for the bus, to review a few words.","善用零碎的空閒時間，例如等公車時，複習幾個單字。","free time","空閒時間",""],["Time yourself on a few tasks, and you will learn to plan more realistically.","替自己做幾件事計時，你就能學會更實際地安排時間。","Time yourself","替自己計時",""],["Spend less time on your phone and more time with real people.","少花點時間滑手機，多花點時間陪身邊真實的人。","Spend","花費（時間、金錢）",""],["Keep a few vocabulary cards in your pocket for spare moments.","在口袋裡放幾張單字卡，利用零碎時間背一背。","spare","空閒的、多餘的",""],["Every evening, check off one goal you finished, no matter how small.","每天晚上，替一個已完成的目標打勾，不管它有多小。","check off","打勾；勾選完成",""],["A cool, dark, quiet room is the best place for deep sleep.","涼爽、昏暗又安靜的房間，最適合熟睡。","deep sleep","熟睡；深層睡眠",""],["Look up at the sky sometimes; the world is bigger than your worries.","偶爾抬頭看看天空，世界比你的煩惱大得多。","worries","煩惱、擔憂",""],["Spelling improves when you write words by hand, not just type them.","親手寫單字，而不只是打字，拼字能力會進步。","Spelling","拼字",""],["Teenagers need about eight to ten hours of sleep, so protect your bedtime.","青少年大約需要八到十小時的睡眠，所以要守住你的就寢時間。","protect","保護；守護",""],["A tidy room can give you a calm and happy mind.","整齊的房間，能讓你的心情平靜又愉快。","tidy","整齊的、整潔的",""],["Learning whole phrases, not just single words, helps you speak more smoothly.","學習完整的片語，而不只是單字，能讓你說得更流暢。","phrases","片語",""],["Choose a set time for studying, and you won't waste energy deciding when to start.","選一個固定的讀書時間，就不必浪費力氣去決定何時開始。","set time","固定的時間",""],["Good sleep and good friends are two keys to a happy life.","充足的睡眠和好朋友，是快樂人生的兩把鑰匙。","keys","關鍵、鑰匙",""],["Read the title and questions first so you know what to look for.","先讀標題和題目，你就知道要找什麼。","title","標題",""],["Tell a friend about your goal, and you'll be more likely to stick to it.","把你的目標告訴朋友，你會更有可能堅持下去。","stick to","堅持；遵守",""],["Comparing yourself to others is the fastest way to lose your joy.","拿自己和別人比較，是失去快樂最快的方法。","Comparing","比較",""],["Pay attention to linking words like \"however\" and \"because\" when you read.","閱讀時，要留意像 however 和 because 這樣的連接詞。","Pay attention to","注意",""],["An hour wasted on regret is an hour you could use to improve.","花在後悔上的一小時，本來可以用來讓自己進步。","regret","後悔",""],["You don't need a perfect life to have a happy day.","你不需要完美的人生，也能擁有快樂的一天。","perfect","完美的",""],["Sometimes the best way to remember a word is to draw a picture of it.","有時候，記住一個單字最好的方法，就是把它畫出來。","draw","畫",""],["Healthy snacks like nuts and fruit keep your energy steady during long study hours.","堅果和水果這類健康點心，能讓你在長時間讀書時保持穩定的精力。","snacks","點心；零食",""],["Plant a flower or water a tree, and watch life grow.","種一朵花或替樹澆澆水，看著生命慢慢成長。","water","澆水",""],["Today's homework is tomorrow's easy question on the exam.","今天的作業，就是明天考卷上的簡單題。","homework","作業",""],["Get up as soon as your alarm rings, and your day will start strong.","鬧鐘一響就起床，你的一天就會有個好的開始。","as soon as","一……就……",""],["Laugh at your own mistakes; it makes them easier to learn from.","笑看自己的錯誤，會讓你更容易從中學習。","learn from","從……中學習",""],["The answer you need is often hidden in the question itself.","你需要的答案，常常就藏在題目本身裡。","hidden","隱藏的",""],["Notice when you study best, morning or night, and use that time well.","留意自己在早上還是晚上讀書效果最好，並好好利用那段時間。","Notice","注意到；察覺",""],["A walk in the park can clear your mind after a long day.","漫長的一天過後，到公園散散步能讓腦袋放空。","clear your mind","讓頭腦清醒、放空思緒",""],["A good learner is not afraid to say, \"I don't understand yet.\"","好的學習者不怕說：「我還不懂。」","afraid","害怕的",""],["You can't control everything, but you can choose your attitude.","你無法控制一切，但你可以選擇自己的態度。","attitude","態度",""],["Mark the words you don't know, then look them up after reading.","把不會的單字標起來，讀完之後再查字典。","look them up","查（字典等）",""],["Laugh, and the world laughs with you.","你笑，全世界都跟著你笑。","laughs","笑","Ella Wheeler Wilcox"],["With English, you can make friends all over the world.","會說英文，你就能結交世界各地的朋友。","all over the world","世界各地",""],["Happiness doesn't come from having more, but from wanting less.","快樂不是來自擁有更多，而是來自想要的少一點。","wanting","想要",""],["Look back to learn, and look ahead to grow.","回顧過去以學習，展望未來以成長。","look ahead","展望未來",""],["Rainy days are perfect for hot chocolate and good conversations.","下雨天最適合喝杯熱可可，好好聊聊天。","conversations","對話、談話",""],["Put English labels on things at home to learn everyday words.","在家裡的物品貼上英文標籤，學習日常生活單字。","labels","標籤",""],["Try something new this week, like a new food or a new route home.","這週試試新事物吧，像是一種新食物或一條新的回家路線。","route","路線",""]].map(r => ({ en: r[0], zh: r[1], word: r[2], wordZh: r[3], src: r[4] }));
